gstrider_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Longstrider\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ad/Longstrider_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Longstrider_(Condition)\" title=\"Longstrider (Condition)\">Longstrider</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Freedom_of_Movement\"> Condition: Freedom of Movement </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Freedom_of_Movement_(Condition)\" title=\"Freedom of Movement (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Freedom_of_Movement_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Freedom_of_Movement_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Freedom_of_Movement_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Freedom_of_Movement_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Freedom_of_Movement_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Freedom_of_Movement_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Freedom of Movement\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Freedom_of_Movement_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Freedom_of_Movement_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Freedom_of_Movement_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Freedom_of_Movement_(Condition)\" title=\"Freedom of Movement (Condition)\">Freedom of Movement</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The affected creature's <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\